MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The smart plug feels like a useful next step because it adds lamp control alongside my connected devices without duplicating something I already own.",
    "The smart displays, HDMI cable, and memory card relate to my home electronics and video equipment, although I would need a clear use and confirmed compatibility before choosing them."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Another HD Fire TV stick adds little because I already have a 4K stick and a Fire TV television; sharing the same streaming features does not make it useful to me now.",
    "Standalone speakers and the speaker-and-bulb bundle fit my interest in connected devices, but I do not have a strong need for them and would start with the simpler smart plug."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My Fire TV purchases seem to have been taken as a reason to recommend more Alexa products, even when they do not address a current need.",
    "Owning streaming equipment seems to have been treated as interest in additional streaming devices, without enough attention to what my existing equipment already does."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "I am more interested in adding a useful capability to my setup than buying another device that repeats an existing function.",
    "Practical fit matters: I would check camera compatibility for a smart display, card specifications for my camcorder, and whether I actually need a longer HDMI connection."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The suggestions recognize my interest in connected home and video equipment, but overestimate my need for more Alexa and streaming devices."
}
